{
  "title": { "zh": "by 后面是一个证明助手", "en": "A proof assistant after by" },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "by 后面也可以是造好的证明助手：自建 auto、化简、证明重建器。它们只用规则，所以这一句照样由核证出。",
        "en": "by may also be followed by a proof assistant already built: your own auto, Simp, the reconstructor. They use only rules, so the row is still proved by the kernel."
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "人写结构，证明助手补小步：真正的证明大多这样分工。",
    "en": "People write the structure and proof assistants fill in the small steps: most real proofs are shared out this way."
  },
